{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方第一块大号白紫文字，尤其是紫色强调的“那些气不该忍”；随后容易被下方同样醒目的蓝白大字吸引。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他仍对过去受过的气感到不服，觉得当初不应该忍下来。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"不服气、委屈；同时有疲惫和难受的情绪。\",\n  \"missed\": \"下方文字进一步表达了不服气逐渐消退、如今已不在那些人身边、只剩难受的变化及其关系。中间小字还补充了音乐、影子和旧日记忆等意象。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"上下两块大号文字都很显眼，争夺主视线。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在两块文字中：上方是不服气、觉得当初不该忍，下方是争得没了力气、如今只剩难受，需要拼接才能理解情绪变化。\",\n    \"两块主文字都是包含多个意思的长句，仅扫高亮词不足以完整判断处境与感受的关系。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "92dcc474-bc7a-462c-af56-f40c29ae99f8", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T012738296882Z", "elapsed_seconds": 47.265, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:28:25.564010+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c52acec0f30c4bb42b72075b7866221b096412cd726fff348cebe87a2d2cbad1", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31